[statement]
apk collects the requirements on a name before deciding it: `a` reaches `lib`
first, with no constraint, and `b` then requires `lib<2`, and `lib` 1.0 is
installed, though 2.0 is offered.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:a b

P:a
V:1
D:lib

P:b
V:1
D:lib<2

P:lib
V:1.0

P:lib
V:2.0

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install lib 1.0
install a 1
install b 1
install app 1
